{
  "_doc": "Frozen fixtures for morning_brief.live_status(). Each scenario overrides a GREEN, fresh, authenticated baseline (see the test's _BASELINE) with the state it is testing, then asserts the resulting lamp outcome. The state-file schemas here are the ones the producers ACTUALLY emit: the WS-E1 alarm state (schema_version/generated_utc/author/watchdog_status/maintenance/reboot_suppressed/any_alarm/sessions{T_LIVE,FTMO}) mirrors D:/QM/reports/ultracode_20260726/wse1/samples/*; the WS-E3 deployment-contract state (overall_status/generated_utc/summary/disk_profile/runtime/findings) mirrors wse3/live_run_state.json. Verbatim producer bytes are additionally exercised from producer_samples/ by test_producer_samples_conformance. A file value of null or '__absent__' => that source is ABSENT (missing). A dict with a __raw__ key => write that literal text (malformed JSON). Deploy-stamp sentinels: manifest_path '__manifest__' -> the materialized manifest path; manifest_sha256 '__manifest_sha256__' -> the real SHA-256 of that manifest. All ages are computed against fixed_now => fully deterministic, NO live/T_Live access.",
